---
title: Crafting life and the endgame
pageSlug: crafting-life
modpack: sc-final-adventure-mechanical-genesis
section: gameplay
order: 2
---

Mechanical Genesis is **create, explore, and conquer** with Create at the center.

**Build and craft.** Intricate machines turn raw inputs into everything the world will not spawn for you. The creatures did not appear naturally — you make them.

**Explore.** Expanded biomes and dimensions hide structures and harder takes on familiar terrain. The world is deeper and stranger than a default 1.20.1 install.

**Quest without hand-holding.** Goals are earned. Experiment with each system before you expect the final steps to make sense.

**Endgame.** The ultimate goal is yours to discover. Plan for long assembly lines; complexity without chaos is the point of the pack.
